    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i guess... but it doesn't feel like a release. it just feels like i'm tired of playing a game that has no rules and no prize. if everything is just a random accident of physics, then why am i even struggling to keep going? it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy weight around for no reason at all.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
